WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.638
- Johnny.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.374
Okay, Carter.

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.643
I can stay here
all night.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.046
So why don't
you and I cut the crap,

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:17.817
and you tell me what happened
on March 15th?

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.153
- And what's in it
for Carter Finley?

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.421
- What's in it
for you

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.258
is I don't send you back
to jail.

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:33.099
- [sighs]

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:36.135
The guy's name
is Cat Branchman.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:39.505
I met him downtown at a club
called "The Clutching Kitten."

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:41.307
You may have heard
of it.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:45.078
It's down on the corner
of Hang and Fur Street.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.381
- Cat Branchman.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:50.516
So what's a guy
like you

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:53.353
and a guy named Cat--

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.229
[sighs]

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:05.098
Okay.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.732
I know what
you're doin', Finley.

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:08.501
You're just using what you see
in my poster.

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.736
- I'm not, detective.

00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:12.805
I'm telling the truth.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:14.173
- We'll see how much truth
you tell

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:15.508
after a few weeks
in solitary confine--

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:17.243
- Fine, detective.

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:20.880
You've twisted my arm.
- Now, that's better.

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:23.282
- The guy's name wasn't
Cat Branchman.

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:24.684
- Thank you.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:29.255
- it was a Chinese guy named
"Mr. Meow."

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:32.125
He's the real
gang boss.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.560
Story went he hung guys
from trees

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.329
and took pictures
of them.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.764
- Finley.
- Used to run a club downtown.

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:42.201
A front, of course.
Called it "The Paw and Poster."

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:43.135
- Finley.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:47.840
- Ran it with a guy named
"Hong in Thar."

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.710
- Okay.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.546
Let's try this
one more time.

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.352
Finley?

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.420
Who do you work for?

00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:03.756
- Um...

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:07.860
Coffee.
Mr. Coffee Coop.

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.363
- You--coffee coop?

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:13.766
- His name was
"Baldy Tall Man Coffee Coop."

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:14.800
- [sighs]

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.736
now you're just talking
about me.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.473
Finley, I'm gonna give you
one more chance.

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.408
Who is in charge?

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:25.745
- His name was
"Angry Man."

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:26.879
- [sighs]

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:29.215
- The warehouse is located

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:33.920
in the Diploma
for being a detective.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.189
- I want a name.
- Justin.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.490
- Thank you.

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:39.759
- Hangtree--
- Don't say "Hang."

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:42.795
God damn it,
do not say "hang."

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.197
- Hang--
- Nope.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:47.533
- Hangman Justin Cats...
- Finley.

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:52.838
- Poster.
- Do not say "poster" or "cat."

00:02:52.871 --> 00:02:54.607
- Cat Poster.
- Okay, that's it.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.842
I'm losing my patience.

00:02:56.875 --> 00:03:00.947
Winslow, get this moron
outta here.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:05.185
- [sighs]

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:16.229
- I'm losing my patience.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:19.665
Let's try this
one more time.

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:22.435
I'm gettin too old
for this [bleep].

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:26.872
[groans]

00:03:26.905 --> 00:03:30.243
- Well-played, detective.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.645
Well-played, indeed.

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:35.615
- Hey, Carter.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:36.848
You hang in there.

